/*
/* Program ........ REH-UNLD
/*
/* Function ....... Unloads one or more archives (NOM 3.4.x, NOM 3.5.x)
/*                  to a portable file/dataset.
/*
/* Plattform ...... BS2000, z/OS
/*
/***********************************************************************
/*
/* Program Description:
/* ------------------------------
/* Accessed DDMs: NRM-ARCHIVE-DATASET, NRM-ACTIVE-REPORTS,
/*                NRM-DATASET-REPORT, NRM-MAIL
/*
/* Needed Natural modules:
/*                RMSPL7-N(SYSNOM), R-NRMCMP(SYSNOM),
/*                NAT23001(SYSLIBS), NAT00083(SYSLIBS),
/*                USR2021N(z/OS, copy from SYSEXT to SYSNOM),
/*                USR2029N(BS2, copy from SYSEXT to SYSNOM)
/* Input Parameter:
/*                Archive Name, processing of multiple archives
/*                  possible with asterisk and/or wildcard.
/*                Space for Portable Archive
/*                  BS2000: Primary and Secondary
/*                  z/OS (batch, TSO): Space-Type, Primary and Secondary
/*                Log level:  0 (least output), 1 (medium, output),
/*                  2 (most output, for every single report)
/*
/***********************************************************************
/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Maintenance:
* SU1     2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power / SAP
*         ÜÜ special pgm: BS2 still inside ÜÜ "IF *OPSYS = MASK('BS2')"
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
